{"seq": 1, "missing": [{"zh": "官方两条来源对宛平城始建年份的换算存在内部矛盾：一条称'始建于明崇祯十三年（1638年）'，但按崇祯纪年换算（崇祯元年为1628年）崇祯十三年应为公元1640年；另一条出土腰牌铭文明确记载'崇祯十三年三月上吉日立'作为建城纪年依据，与1638年的换算不一致", "tier_sensitive": false, "en": "The two official sources contain an internal inconsistency in converting the founding year of Wanping City: one states that it was founded in the 13th year of the Chongzhen reign of the Ming dynasty (1638), but conversion according to the Chongzhen reign (with the first year being 1628) indicates that the 13th year should be 1640 CE; the other explicitly records on the excavated waist plaque inscription “erected on an auspicious day in the third month of the 13th year of the Chongzhen reign” as the basis for dating the city’s construction, which is inconsistent with the conversion to 1638."}], "found_factual_error": true, "error_note_zh": "官方来源对始建年份的公元换算自相矛盾：称'崇祯十三年'等于1638年，但该年号实际对应1640年（与gate_history来源中腰牌铭文'崇祯十三年三月'的建城纪年及另一来源'竣工于1640年'的表述不符）。", "top_missing_zh": "官方两条来源对宛平城始建年份的换算存在内部矛盾：一条称'始建于明崇祯十三年（1638年）'，但按崇祯纪年换算（崇祯元年为1628年）崇祯十三年应为公元1640年；另一条出土腰牌铭文明确记载'崇祯十三年三月上吉日立'作为建城纪年依据，与1638年的换算不一致", "top_missing_en": "The two official sources contain an internal inconsistency in converting the founding year of Wanping City: one states that it was founded in the 13th year of the Chongzhen reign of the Ming dynasty (1638), but conversion according to the Chongzhen reign (with the first year being 1628) indicates that the 13th year should be 1640 CE; the other explicitly records on the excavated waist plaque inscription “erected on an auspicious day in the third month of the 13th year of the Chongzhen reign” as the basis for dating the city’s construction, which is inconsistent with the conversion to 1638.", "error_note_en": "The official source is internally inconsistent in converting the founding year to the Common Era: it states that the 13th year of the Chongzhen reign equals 1638, but that reign year actually corresponds to 1640 (inconsistent with both the city-construction dating